<testcase>
  <info>
    <p>
      An element list that starts part-way down the page-sequence's first page, after a span change: an unmarked
      span="all" block, then a marked two-column part. The first page was made before the parts were found; it keeps its
      owner, and its columns the height left on it, whatever master the new part names. First sequence: a master
      with the same body as the one in force (docx4j corpus documents 79 and 8940, where the marker carries a
      restart). Second: a master with a 40pt top margin. Before, the first page's columns were measured as a fresh
      page of the new part's master, and overflowed it.
    </p>
  </info>
